# Continuity segment controls

Every reference capsule has a **segment** door, matching ComfyUI-Continuity-Mac:

| Kind | Temporal (`TrimEditor` / `trim.js`) | Spatial (`PictureEditor` / `picture.js`) |
|------|-------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| image | — | crop / turn / mirror / aspect lock |
| audio | in–out + waveform | — |
| video / silent_video / video_audio | in–out + waveform + track switch | Crop button → same picture editor |

- Trim blob: `{ start, end }` seconds (null = whole).
- Crop blob: `{ x, y, w, h, turn, mirror }` fractions after turn/mirror (`h3_crop.py`).
- Materialize under `upload_dir/edited/` before generate; validate audio limits on the trimmed files.
- Do not invent a third editor — port Continuity UX (labels: "whole", "0:02–0:07", "cropped · ↻ 90°").
